    "description": "Bleutec Industries develops vessel-based installation and marine service solutions for the U.S. offshore wind sector. Its target customers are offshore wind developers and contractors that require Jones Act-compliant transportation and installation capability for foundations and turbines. The model is asset-heavy because it is based on building, owning, and operating specialized marine equipment, including the company's Binary Marine Installation Solution platform. Public sources identify Houston as the company's base and frame its addressable market as the U.S. offshore wind installation sector. Bleutec has disclosed its BMIS concept can install turbines of up to 22 MW, but broader revenue and fleet scale metrics were not publicly disclosed in the reviewed materials. EnCap announced a capital commitment in 2022 to support the platform, and exact ownership percentages were not publicly disclosed.",
